OL,1,Vk4                               G4/21
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGBAKER HAS TALKS WITH
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGARAB NATIONS
OL,4,    F
OL,5, US Secretary of State James Baker has
OL,6, spoken of views moving closer together
OL,7, after talks in Saudi Arabia with
OL,8, ministers from eight Arab countries.
OL,10,FThe 90-minute meeting involved Egypt,
OL,11,FSyria and the six nations of the Gulf
OL,12,FCo-operation Council.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FThey discussed the peace and security
OL,15,Fof the region; however, the Palestinian
OL,16,Fissue is not thought to have been
OL,17,Fdiscussed in any detail.
OL,19,FMr Baker has now flown to Egypt for the
OL,20,Fnext leg of his Middle East tour.
OL,21,F
OL,22,D]F This Ceefax page is fromG10-03-91
OL,23,D] FMuch more at: teletextarchive.com
