OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1773166943
OL,1,Vk4                               G6/21
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGKURDS "CAPTURE IMPORTANT
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGTOWNS" IN IRAQ
OL,5, A Kurdish opposition spokesman based in
OL,6, Iran has said Kurdish rebels are about
OL,7, to capture the Iraqi city of Kirkuk.
OL,9,FKurdish guerrillas have already said
OL,10,Fthey have taken control of Kalar and
OL,11,FKofra in Kirkuk province in their
OL,12,Fuprising against Saddam Hussein.
OL,14,FThey say they have full control of
OL,15,FSuleimaniyeh province and 80% control
OL,16,Fof Erbil and 60% of Kirkuk provinces.
OL,18,FMeanwhile, vice-president Dan Quayle
OL,19,Fhas reiterated a United States' warning
OL,20,Fto Saddam Hussein not to use chemical
OL,21,Fweapons against dissidents.
OL,22,F
OL,23,D]FFromG10-03-91F/ teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
